                <head>Part II.—Laws of the United States.</head>
                <p>[<hi rendition="#italic">For the summaries of the laws and discussions on this
                        subject which were in the appendix to the Commissioner’s Report it has been
                        thought best to substitute the statutes themselves; an explanation of the
                        provisions of the various treaties with other powers; and a copy of
                        theinstructions to consuls on the subject of protection and
                    passports</hi>.]</p>

